            </note>
            <note corresp="#d2-f3" n="3" xml:id="d2-f3-content">
                <p>Cutler’s briefing note is printed below. The minutes of all National Security
                    Council meetings are in the National Archives and Records Administration, RG
                    273, Records of the National Security Council, Official Meeting Minutes
                    File.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d2-f4" n="4" xml:id="d2-f4-content">
                <p>Paragraphs a and b and the Note that follows constitute NSC Action No. 1853.
                    (Department of State, S/S–NSC (Miscellaneous) Files: Lot 66 D 95, Records of
                    Action by the National Security Council)</p>
            </note>
